{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation on multiprofile RNA data using PCA encoding, comparing it to the previous avgpool aggregation baseline (config_002). Validation accuracy (0.519) and F1 (0.4797) are lower than config_002, suggesting transformer aggregation may not improve performance in this setup. Uncertainty remains about the optimal aggregation method and the potential benefits of multimodal components, as this experiment isolates only the aggregation approach without image modalities."
}

